---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import ContactCta from '../components/ContactCta.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Jutt AI Tools" description="Learn about Jutt AI Tools, a free collection of practical AI generators and browser-based utilities." url="/about">
  <Navbar />
  <main>
    <section class="page-top">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Jutt AI Tools</p>
      <h1>Useful online tools, made easy to access.</h1>
      <p>Jutt AI Tools brings practical AI-powered generators and fast browser-based utilities together in one place. Create and transform content without installing software or sending client-side utility data to an API.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="story-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">A growing tool library</p>
        <h2>One simple place for everyday writing and utility tasks.</h2>
        <p>Use AI tools for content ideas, scripts, captions, and rewrites, or choose in-browser tools for text counts, formatting, encoding, and conversions. New tools can be added to the shared catalog as the library grows.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Privacy-minded utilities</p>
        <h2>Use the right tool for the task.</h2>
        <p>Client-side utilities process their input locally in your browser. AI generators send submitted prompts to the configured AI provider to produce a response. Avoid entering sensitive personal information into online tools.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="values-grid">
      <article class="value-card">
        <h3>Clarity</h3>
        <p>Each tool is designed to make a common task quick to find and straightforward to use.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="value-card">
        <h3>Useful by default</h3>
        <p>We focus on practical outputs and browser-based tools that work without extra steps.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="value-card">
        <h3>Growing library</h3>
        <p>The tool collection can expand as new everyday needs and ideas come up.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <ContactCta title="Ready to try a tool?" href="/#tools" />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-top {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 2rem));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .page-top h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.06;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .page-top p:last-child {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    max-width: 760px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
  }

  main {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 2rem));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .story-grid,
  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  .story-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .card,
  .value-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .card h2,
  .value-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
  }

  .card p,
  .value-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .values-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .story-grid,
    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
